    "char_start": 6430,
    "char_end": 6651,
    "quote": "When used in combination with methotrexate, to reduce the signs and symptoms, inhibit the progression of structural damage and improve physical function in patients with moderately to severely active rheumatoid arthritis."
  },
  "compiled_from": "The drug L35677 names alongside infliximab for the rheumatoid arthritis indication, expanded to every RxNorm concept RxNav relates to its ingredient.",
